<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 114-4 V ENGLAND (172) 4TH TEST - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 114-4 V ENGLAND (172) 4TH TEST - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>LEEDS, England 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 114 for</p>
<p>four in reply to England's first innings score of 172 at tea on</p>
<p>the second day of the fourth test at Headingley on Friday.</p>
</text>
